menu "Build output"

config MCUX_BUILD_OUTPUT_HEX
    bool "Build an Intel HEX file from the application"
    default y
    help
      Build an Intel HEX (.hex) output file from the application ELF as a
      POST_BUILD step. The .hex file is consumed by west flash and most NXP
      production programming tools (LinkServer, blhost, MSD drag-and-drop).

config MCUX_BUILD_OUTPUT_BIN
    bool "Build a raw binary file from the application"
    help
      Build a raw binary (.bin) output file from the application ELF as a
      POST_BUILD step. Useful for bootloaders or tools that require a flat
      binary image. Note: a base flash address is required at load time.

endmenu
